## Notes / environment limitations

- Real flashing to physical media was not exercised because no removable card
  reader is attached to this Mac; the documented no-reader path is exit 2, and
  the interactive picker/writer was exercised through the fake-device unit suite.
- The Ubuntu integration test command used the task-provided `python:3.12-slim`
  base (Debian trixie in this environment) rather than the Dockerfile's pinned
  bookworm digest; the Dockerfile image used for the macOS build path is pinned.
- The auxiliary artifact capture copied the source into /tmp inside a one-shot
  privileged container and mounted the worktree read-only, so the worktree
  remained untouched.

